WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Ryu remains standing after the light-Edge prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.250
Crouching medium kick trades with Ryu’s jab.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.050
Standing heavy punch links after the recorded trade.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.450
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.550
The air grab catches the launch.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.100
The trade conversion ends in a hard knockdown.
